# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Build output ---
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Test / coverage output ---
**/coverage/

# --- Generated Spine / Protobuf output ---
**/generated/
**/.generated*
**/.spine-proto-generation.json
**/.spine-proto-generate.lock.*

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log

# --- Environment & secrets (never put real credentials into an image) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.certs/

# --- Repository, editor, and agent metadata ---
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
.codex/
**/.eslintcache

# --- OS ---
**/.DS_Store
